transformation. The size is 64 since

00:57:13.200 --> 00:57:21.840
our matrix is four by four, so we have 16
elements. Each element is a floating 32 number,

00:57:21.840 --> 00:57:29.120
so its size is 64. We then define
the binding group by calling Create Binding group

00:57:29.120 --> 00:57:37.200
for this uniform buffer. Here we set the layout
as a default pipeline get binding group layout

00:57:37.200 --> 00:57:44.480
zero. This means we use the binding group
zero layout. In the entries attribute, we set

00:57:44.480 --> 00:57:50.960
the bindings to zero and set buffer here
to the uniform buffer we just defined here.

00:57:50.960 --> 00:58:00.160
If we have a more uniform buffers, we can add the
elements here. Put them into this entries array. In

00:58:00.160 --> 00:58:08.080
addition to the texture view from a context we
also introduce the depth texture. Here we set

